IntelliJ New UI icon set
========================

Source: https://github.com/JetBrains/intellij-community
Path in the source: platform/icons/src/expui
Commit: d5b79b0022b004b719c1d733975856ad7ec7779b (2026-11-17)
License: Apache-2.0. Every copied SVG keeps the copyright line of the source:
"Copyright 2000-2023 JetBrains s.r.o. and contributors. Use of this source code is
governed by the Apache 2.0 license." The full license text is in LICENSE, the NOTICE
of the source repository in NOTICE.

The files keep the paths of the source below platform/icons/src/expui, without the
product logos: the folders `welcome`, `ultimate`, `meetNewUi`, `survey` and `ide` are
not part of this set. `map.toml` maps the logical icon names of the window to the paths
here; a name that is missing there has no icon in this set and comes from `arro`.

The tool window icons keep the `@20x20` files of the source for the stripes.

`fileTypes/gitignore` and `fileTypes/http` have no dark variant in the source; the light
file is copied under the `_dark` name too.

Files added 2026-11-22 from the same commit, light and `_dark`, below the same
`platform/icons/src/expui/fileTypes`:

- `properties`
- `archive`
- `image`
- `csv`
- `editorConfig`
- `manifest`
- `patch`
- `microsoftWindows`
- `xsd`
- `graphql`
- `terraform`
- `hprof`
- `jfr`
- `gradle`
- `javaClass`
